OL,3,ASecurity flaw found in Java, world's
OL,4,Athird-largest programming language
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe discovery comes after a string of
OL,7,Fserious technology issues, including a
OL,8,Fmassive Microsoft outage and a network
OL,9,Ffailure that grounded all US flights.
OL,10,FUS Secretary of State Marco Rubio said
OL,11,Fthere is "zero evidence" the incidents
OL,12,Fare related.
